  "details": "It's no fun, whenever there are a lot of players on vrchat, the \"processing upload\" step after uploading your data takes like  10 minutes, where it normally takes a few seconds only in the morning for me. At this time, according to https://metrics.vrch.at/, vrchat always never has many players on, not many api errors and the photon servers break less. But as the time goes on and many people get on again, uploads will take an eternity again.",
